   $q$The writer wants readers to learn what a glacier is before anything else. Which sentence should be moved to the very beginning?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence 13","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"detail-before-definition"},{"text":"sentence 2","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence 8","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"detail-before-definition"},{"text":"sentence 3","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cause-before-definition"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence 2$q$, $q$Sentence 2 defines a glacier, so placing it first gives readers the meaning before the details. Sentence 3 explains where glaciers form, which makes more sense once readers know what a glacier is.$q$, 'draft', 'd8959c71-718a-5511-93fa-d9e3b9351460')
