   $q$Which revision of sentence 6 tells most clearly how much time passed?$q$, $q$[{"text":"We searched, and it was very hard to do.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"vague-language-telling"},{"text":"We searched because Pepper was lost.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cause-not-time"},{"text":"We searched until the streetlights flickered on.","is_correct":true},{"text":"We searched for a really, really long time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"vague-language"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$We searched until the streetlights flickered on.$q$, $q$Streetlights flickering on is a concrete detail that shows hours have passed and evening has come. Adding "really, really" still leaves the amount of time vague.$q$, 'draft', '9486b3b9-edfe-54a1-8296-3bc1ac50b348')
