   $q$Which sentence should be removed because it does not belong in the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence 13","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-event"},{"text":"sentence 11","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-sensory-detail"},{"text":"sentence 4","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-dialogue"},{"text":"sentence 12","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence 12$q$, $q$The neighbor's car has nothing to do with watching the eclipse. Sentence 11 should stay because the cool air and quiet birds help the reader feel the moment.$q$, 'draft', '7f47078a-3e1b-5a9a-b377-48ed0abd9c51')
