insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('f2e2a17c-d73f-5bb1-a1c1-fd46509150ca', 'wg5-narrative-writing-p04', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g5-narrative-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$The Third Leg$q$, $q$(1) Field day at Brookside Elementary was finally here, and I was running the third leg of the fifth-grade relay. (2) My teammates were Lucia, Omar, and Wren. (3) We had practiced handing off the baton every day at recess for two weeks. (4) The whistle blew, and Lucia shot forward. (5) She passed the baton to Omar, who raced around the curve. (6) My heart pounded as he got closer.

(7) I reached back, but the baton slipped through my fingers and bounced on the track. (8) I grabbed it and ran as fast as I could. (9) Two runners had already passed us. (10) I caught one of them right before I handed off to Wren. (11) Wren ran like the wind and crossed the finish line in second place. (12) Our class cheered.

(13) Second place is good.$q$, 'draft')
