   $q$Read the sentence: "The scientist studied the planets through a tool that makes faraway things look closer." Which words would replace "a tool that makes faraway things look closer" most precisely?$q$, $q$[{"text":"a telescope","is_correct":true},{"text":"a microscope","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-meaning"},{"text":"a thing","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"vague-noun"},{"text":"a camera","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-meaning"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$a telescope$q$, $q$A telescope is the exact name for a tool that makes faraway objects look closer. A microscope also magnifies, but it is used for tiny things up close, not faraway planets.$q$, 'draft', null)
