   $q$In a story, eight-year-old Benji is excited to meet his cousin at the airport. Which line of dialogue sounds most natural for Benji?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"Yay, you're finally here! I missed you so much!\"","is_correct":true},{"text":"\"I see that you have arrived here now.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"flat-no-feeling"},{"text":"\"Greetings, cousin. I am pleased by your arrival.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-formal"},{"text":"\"Your arrival has been noted with great happiness.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-formal-stiff"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"Yay, you're finally here! I missed you so much!"$q$, $q$Story dialogue should sound like the character, and an excited young child would speak in short, casual bursts. "Greetings, cousin. I am pleased by your arrival." is correct but sounds like a stiff adult, not a happy eight-year-old.$q$, 'draft', null)
