-- Passage wg6-argument-writing-p01
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('4a1d66de-fe3c-5482-9c57-7e168e6035b5', 'wg6-argument-writing-p01', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-argument-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Pen Pals Across the Ocean$q$, $q$(1) Most students at Westbrook Middle School have never spoken with a student their age from another country. (2) Our school should start a pen pal program with a partner school overseas. (3) Writing real letters gives students a reason to practice careful spelling and clear sentences. (4) When students know a real person will read their words, they usually take more care. (5) ______ letters teach students about daily life, food, and holidays in another place.

(6) Some teachers worry that a pen pal program would take time away from regular lessons. (7) This is a fair concern, since class time is limited. (8) However, the letters could be written during the writing block that already exists, so no lesson would be lost. (9) Mr. Okafor's class tried this last spring, and his students still finished every required writing assignment on time. (10) My cousin collects stamps from twelve different countries.

(11) A pen pal program would help students write better and understand the wider world. (12) Westbrook should find a partner school before the new term begins.$q$, 'draft')
on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body
where public.passages.status = 'draft';
