   $q$Which sentence should the writer delete because it does not support the claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (10)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (7)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-counterclaim"},{"text":"sentence (9)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (4)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-reasoning"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (10)$q$, $q$Sentence (10) is about a cousin's stamp collection, which has nothing to do with starting a pen pal program. Sentence (7) should stay because it fairly admits the teachers' concern before the writer answers it.$q$, 'draft', '4a1d66de-fe3c-5482-9c57-7e168e6035b5')
