   $q$Which sentence should the writer remove because it does not help the argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (10)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-conclusion"},{"text":"sentence (3)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-reasoning"},{"text":"sentence (7)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-counterclaim"},{"text":"sentence (9)","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (9)$q$, $q$Sentence (9) describes colorful keyboards, which has nothing to do with when typing should be taught. Sentence (7) belongs because it fairly grants part of the parents' view before the writer responds.$q$, 'draft', '78d35ea2-2fd1-59e5-b55b-d8ee6d5708f8')
