  ('1706ec83-d4d8-5683-897d-29606ba4655d', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-argument-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$The writer wants to add evidence after sentence (8) to show that typing lessons would not hurt handwriting. Which sentence is best?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Handwriting was taught in schools long before computers were invented.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Many adults today type far more often than they write by hand.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-evidence"},{"text":"The writer's younger sister already likes to type stories at home.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"weak-anecdote"},{"text":"In a nearby district, fourth graders who had short typing lessons scored just as well on handwriting checks as those who had none.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In a nearby district, fourth graders who had short typing lessons scored just as well on handwriting checks as those who had none.$q$, $q$The correct sentence directly shows that typing lessons did not lower handwriting scores, which answers the parents' worry. The fact about adults typing more is true but does not show anything about handwriting skills.$q$, 'draft', '78d35ea2-2fd1-59e5-b55b-d8ee6d5708f8')
