   $q$Which sentence breaks the story's first-person point of view and should be revised?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence 5","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-pov-shift"},{"text":"sentence 9","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-pov-shift"},{"text":"sentence 3","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-pov-shift"},{"text":"sentence 7","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence 7$q$, $q$The story is told by the narrator using "I," but sentence 7 suddenly calls the narrator "Kofi" and "himself." Sentence 9 is in first person with "My stomach," so it fits.$q$, 'draft', '04e95910-35e4-5536-b2f8-12df363a0c07')
