values
  ('43b9f264-1367-5afc-972d-2b7923a3b47d', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-narrative-writing'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Lucia's dialogue in sentence 11 is important to the plot because:$q$, $q$[{"text":"it leads the narrator to decide to wait instead of starting over.","is_correct":true},{"text":"it ends the story by solving every problem the narrator has.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-role"},{"text":"it explains to the reader how salt dissolves in warm water.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-dialogue"},{"text":"it shows that Lucia knows more about science than Mr. Okafor does.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$it leads the narrator to decide to wait instead of starting over.$q$, $q$Right after Lucia speaks, the narrator says "I decided to wait" in sentence 12, so Lucia's words turn the story away from dumping out the jar. Nothing in the text compares Lucia's knowledge with Mr. Okafor's.$q$, 'draft', '7cb4378e-37ad-50a0-ae28-b30316e332e2')
